    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 273]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Minister of Fisheries and Aquatic Resources Developmenton 22nd October, 2013\n\n(Published in the Gazette on October 07, 2013)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 21.00Postage : Rs. 15. 00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-PL 007686 \u20141,100 (10/2013)\n\nFISHERIES AND AQUATIC RESOURCES(AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Fisheries and Aquatic ResourcesAct, No. 2 of 1996\n\n1Fisheries and Aquatic Resources (Amendment)\n\n2\u2014PL 007593\u2014 475 (09/2013)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nL. D.\u2014O. 1/2011.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE FISHERIES AND AQUATIC RESOURCESACT, NO. 2 OF 1996\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Fisheries and AquaticResources (Amendment) Act, No. of 2013.\n\n2.The long title to the Fisheries and Aquatic ResourcesAct, No. 2 of 1996 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended, by the substitution, for thewords and figures \u201cFISHERIES AND AQUATIC RESOURCES INSRI LANKA; TO REPEAL THE FISHERIES ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 212),\u201d,\n\nOF THE WORDS \u201cFISHERIES AND AQUATIC RESOURCES IN SRI LANKA;\n\nTO GIVE EFFECT TO SRI LANKA\u2019S OBLIGATIONS UNDER CERTAININTERNATIONAL AND REGIONAL FISHERIES AGREEMENTS; TO REPEAL THEFISHERIES ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 212),\u201d.\n\n3.Section 3 of the principal enactment is herebyamended in subsection (1) of that section as follows:\u2014\n\n(1)by the repeal of paragraphs (b), (c), (d) and (e) ofthat subsection and the substitution therefor of thefollowing paragraphs:\u2014\n\n\u201c(b)the Director-General;\n\n(c)the Secretary to the Ministry of the Ministerof the Board of Minsters of every province towhom the subject of fisheries has beenassigned;\n\n(d)the Chairman of the Council of the NationalInstitute of Fisheries and Nautical\n\nShort title."
