    "chunk_size_bytes": 1510,
    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 280]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. (Mrs.) Anoma Gamage M. P. on 19th December, 2013\n\n(Published in the Gazette on December 09, 2013)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 5. 00\n\n2-2d\n\nDAYA SARANA DEVELOPMENT FOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Daya Sarana Development Foundation\n\n1Daya Sarana Development Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n2\u2014PL 007773\u2014 75 (11/2013)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE DAYA SARANA DEVELOPMENTFOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the\u201cDaya Sarana Development Foundation\u201d has beenestablished in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out and transacting all objects and mattersconnected with the said Foundation according to the rulesagreed to the members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Daya SaranaDevelopment Foundation (Incorporation) Act,No. of 2013."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_bills",
    "doc_id": "2013-09-09-2013-09-09-54-2013-en",
    "num": "2013-09-09-54-2013-en",
