    "chunk_size_bytes": 1971,
    "chunk_text": "(h)to liaise with the Foreign Employemtn Bureau underthe Central Government to facilitate applicationsfrom eligible youth in the area and recommend themfor suitable foreign job opportunities;\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n3Daya Sarana Development Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(j)to set-up an Employment Bank which will collectdata of youth in the area together with theireducational qualifications in order to find suitableemployment in keeping with their educationalstandards, capabilities and experience;\n\n(k)to encourage, advice, aid and assist youthfinancially and otherwise to develop their personalskills for self employment and also find markets forproducts of those self-employed persons;\n\n(l)to undertake feasibility studies in the agricultural,industrual, technical and other allied fields and topromote the general economic and social welfareof the people of the area;\n\n(m)to aid and assist youth to commence and operatecottage industries for self employment with a viewto uplift their living standards;\n\n(n) to provide agricultural equipment/machinery foryouth to develop and facilitate agricultural andindustrial project in the area.\n\n4.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power includingthe following powers to do, perform and execute all suchacts, matters and things whatsoever as are necessary ordesirable for the promotion or furtherance of the objects ofthe Corporation or any one of them:\u2014\n\n(a) to procure the Corporation to be registered,incorporated or otherwise empowered or representedor to open liaison offices in any country or placeoutside the Democratic Socialist Republic ofSri Lanka;\n\n30\n\nGeneralPowers of theCorporation.\n\n4Daya Sarana Development Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(b) to receive or collect grant, gifts, donations, subsidies,endowments and subscriptions whether in cash orin material from donors in Sri Lanka or elsewhere;"
