    "chunk_text": "4Daya Sarana Development Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(b) to receive or collect grant, gifts, donations, subsidies,endowments and subscriptions whether in cash orin material from donors in Sri Lanka or elsewhere;\n\n(d) to take responsible, just and legitimate steps toremove obstacles to the attainment of the aboveobjects;\n\n(e) to purchase, take on lease or exchange, hire orotherwise acquire any movable property and anyrights, privileges necessary or expendient forpromotion of the objects of the Corporation and toconstruct, maintain and alter any buildings orerections required for the work of the Corporation;\n\n(f) to receive, purchase, sell or acquire all forms ofproperties both movable or immovable, shares incommercial, industrial and banking enterprises andto accept property bequeathed by deed, last will orcodicil;\n\n(g) to collaborate with, assist and receive assistance fromother persons and or organizations engaged insimilar activities, whether in Sri Lanka or elsewhere;\n\n(h) to maintain liaison and affiliation with other relatedorganizations and to enter into agreement withpersons or organizations in Sri Lanka or elsewherein pursuance of the vision and objectives of theCorporation;\n\n(i) to enter in to any contract or agreement with anyperson, government, organization, company orinstitution whether in Sri Lanka or elsewhere;\n\n5Daya Sarana Development Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(j) to open and maintain current, saving and depositaccounts with any bank or other similar institutions;\n\n(k) to borrow moneys for the purpose of the Corporationon such terms and conditions and with or withoutsecurity as may be determined from time to time;\n\n(l) to make, repeal, alter or amend Rules andRegulations defining the manner of managementof the corporation and all necessary-by-laws orordinance for the regulations and conduct of itsaffairs and the various branches of its activities;"
