    "chunk_size_bytes": 1864,
    "chunk_text": "(2) The Founder Member Mr. Daya Dharmapala KilittuwaGamage, shall be the first President of the Committee ofManagement. Any casual vacancy occurring in theCommittee of Management shall be filled by the Committeeitself subject to ratification by the General Body at its verynext meeting. The quorum for a Committee of Managementshall be one third of the Members of the Committee.\n\n(3) The first Committee of Management of theCorporation shall be the Committee of Management of theFoundation holding office on the day preceding the date ofcommencement of this Act.\n\n(a)The election, appointment or nomination ofmembers of the Committee of Management and theirpowers and duties and terms of office;\n\n(b)The powers conduct of duties and functions ofvarious officers, agents and servants of theCorporation;\n\n(c)The procedure to be observed at the, summoningand holding of meeting of the corporation and ofthe Committee of Management, the time place,notice and agenda of such meetings, the quorumand the general conduct of such meeting;\n\n(d)Qualifications and disqualifications for themembership of the Board Management of theCorporation;\n\n(e)Administration, Management and custody of theassets of the Corporation and maintenance andauditing of its funds and accounts;\n\nRules of theCorporation.\n\n7Daya Sarana Development Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(f)General administration of the Corporation andrealization of its objects.\n\n(2) Any such rule when made under subsection one (1)above, may at a like meeting and in like manner be altered,added to, amended or rescinded.\n\n(3) The rules of the Corporation in force on the dayimmediately preceding the date of commencement of thisAct, shall in so far as they are not inconsistent with theprovisions of this Act or any other written Law, be deemedto be rules of the Corporation made under this section."
