    "chunk_text": "(3) The rules of the Corporation in force on the dayimmediately preceding the date of commencement of thisAct, shall in so far as they are not inconsistent with theprovisions of this Act or any other written Law, be deemedto be rules of the Corporation made under this section.\n\n7.The seal of the Corporation shall not be affixed toany instrument, except with the authority of a resolution ofthe Committee of Management and shall be authenticatedby the signature of the President and Secretary or some othertwo members as may be named for that purpose.\n\n8.All debts and liabilities of the Foundation on theday preceding the date of commencement of this Act shallbe paid to the Corporation hereby constituted and all debtsdue to and subscriptions and contributions payable to theFoundation on that day shall be paid to the Corporation forthe purpose of this Act.\n\n9.(1) The Corporation shall have its own fund and allthe sums of money granted or donated to the Corporation byany foreign or local public or private authority or individual,and all the sums of money received by the Corporation inthe carrying on of its affairs shall be credited to the fund.\n\n(2) The funds of the Corporation which are notimmediately necessary, shall be deposited in any Bank orother institution and the proceeds by way of interest on suchdeposits shall be utilized for the purposes of the Corporation.\n\nSeal of theCorporation.\n\nDebts due byand payableto theFoundation.\n\nFund of theCorporation.\n\n8Daya Sarana Development Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n(3) The Committee may exercise all the powers of theCorporation to borrow money and to mortgage or charge itsundertaking any property or any part thereof as security forany debt liability or obligation of the Corporation or of anythird party."
