    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPresented by Hon. (Mrs.) Sriyani Wijewickrama, M.P. forDigamadulla District on 09th July, 2013\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 253]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n(Published in the Gazette on June 17, 2013)\n\nSIVMUNI SE VEHERA BUDDHIST FOUNDATION(INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Sivmuni Se Vehera Buddhist Foundation\n\nSivmuni Se Vehera Buddhist Foundation(Incorporation)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n2\u2014PL 007284\u201475 (05/2013)\n\n20\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SIVMUNI SE VEHERA BUDDHISTFOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS an Foundation called and known as the\u201cSivmuni Se Vehera Buddhist Foundation\u201d has heretoforebeen formed in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out its objects and transacting all matters connectedwith the said Foundation according to the rules agreed to byits members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated, and it will be expedient to grant the saidapplication :\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sivmuni Se VeheraBuddhist Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2013."
