    "chunk_size_bytes": 1962,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka CulturalFoundation for the Building of Culture and Morals(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2013.\n\nIncorporationof theSri LankaCulturalFoundationfor theBuilding ofCulture andMorals.\n\n2Sri Lanka Cultural Foundation for the Buildingof Culture and Morals (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to resolve and encourage member unions for thepromulgation of relief services functions, and toprevent the poverty stricken situations from whichmen suffer;\n\n(b)to form and foster a union for cultural services inevery country and to provide for incentives andpromotion and to establish the policies of the mainorganization within this union;\n\n(c)to create and assist the projects for pre-disasterpreparation, at the national, regional andinternational level;\n\n(d)to establish and utilize the required resources forsocial services, cultural restoration activities andpersonality development;\n\n(e)to treat all nationals with equality, respecting theircultures, protecting all wayward artists andproviding relief work to them, as much as possible;\n\n(f)to organize with close cooperation of the nationalunions and member unions in accordance with thecommon aims of the Corporation as well ascoordinating and operating;\n\n(g)to provide an efficient organizational frameworkand information distribution infrastructure facilitiesat the national and regional level;\n\n(h)to present certificates of skills esteemed certificatesof incentives, esteemed incentives, honorary consolawards, training artists and conducting programmes,creating the required background for them and itscontinuous maintenance;\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n30\n\n3Sri Lanka Cultural Foundation for the Buildingof Culture and Morals (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30"
