    "chunk_text": "(h)to present certificates of skills esteemed certificatesof incentives, esteemed incentives, honorary consolawards, training artists and conducting programmes,creating the required background for them and itscontinuous maintenance;\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n30\n\n3Sri Lanka Cultural Foundation for the Buildingof Culture and Morals (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(j)to obtain the cooperation of philanthropists and todevelop relationships with other organizations andsolicit their help and assistance;\n\n(k)to issue of an identity card to those members of theFoundation for social and cultural servicesenriching them to conduct matters as privilegedcitizens;\n\n(l)to develop friendship, inter action and coordinationamong national members of organizations inkeeping with the common aims of the Corporation;\n\n(m)to inculcate the importance of mankind to the variedhuman groups, to re-enliven and proclaim theculture of our past glory, and thereby contribute tothe growth of a humble and righteous society;\n\n(n)to legislate, promote and popularize people friendlylaws when ever required; and\n\n(o)to do all such other acts and things as are necessary,conducive or incidental to the attainment of theobjects of the Corporation.\n\n4.(1) The affairs of the Corporation shall subject to theother provisions of this Act and the rules in force for the timebeing of the Corporation, be administered by a SuperiorCommittee consisting of the Chairman / Director General,Administrative Secretary, Senior Vice Chairman, ViceChairman, Regional Organizer and Deputy Director Generalto be elected in accordance with such rules in force for thetime being of the Corporation.\n\nManagementof the affairsof theCorporation.\n\n4Sri Lanka Cultural Foundation for the Buildingof Culture and Morals (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30"
