    "chunk_text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons as now are members of theSri Siddhartha Foundation (hereinafter referred to as\u201cFoundation\u201d), or shall hereafter be admitted as members ofthe Corporation hereby constituted, shall be a body corporate(hereinafter referred to as \u201cthe Corporation\u201d) with perpetualsuccession under the name and style of the \u201cSri SiddharthaFoundation\u201d, and by that name may sue and be sued, withfull power and authority to have and use a common seal andto alter the same at its pleasure.\n\n(a)organizing and conducting of all activities for theimprovement of Buddhist Culture and moraldevelopment;\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort Title.\n\nIncorporationof the SriSiddharthaFoundation.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n30\n\nSri Siddhartha Foundation (Incorporation)2\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(b)to establish and maintain educational institutes,Hostels for male and female Students and toadvance and promote the education of needychildren;\n\n(c)to grant financial aid and award scholarships toneedy students;\n\n(d)to provide necessary aid to victims of naturaldisasters;\n\n(e)to engage in social services;\n\n(f)to provide medical facilities, nutritious food,clothing and housing to the poor, the orphans andthe sick;\n\n(g)to provide welfare facilities to the deaf, dumb andthe blind;\n\n(h)to establish and maintain elders\u2019 home;\n\n(i)to engage in cultural activities;\n\n(j)to promote the education of the clergy and the laityby conducting courses of study in Sinhala, Pali,Sanskrit, Buddhism and Ayurvedic Medicine;\n\n(k)to conduct sermons, Buddha pujas, Chethiya pujas,Bodhi pujas, Meditation classes, discussions,seminars, lectures and tours;\n\n(l)to promote the education of Ayurvedic andIndegenous Medicine;\n\n(m)to promote the mutual understanding and harmonyamong the people irrespective of race or religion;\n\n(n)to promote and maintain projects necessary for theprotection, management and preservation ofenvironment;\n\n3Sri Siddhartha Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30"
