    "chunk_text": "(m)to promote the mutual understanding and harmonyamong the people irrespective of race or religion;\n\n(n)to promote and maintain projects necessary for theprotection, management and preservation ofenvironment;\n\n3Sri Siddhartha Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(p)to provide training in small industries to studentsand to assist them financially or other wise tobecome useful citizens;\n\n(q)to promote and uplift education by establishmentand maintenance of schools and other educationalinstitution;\n\n(r)to establish and maintain an Institute of CommunityDevelopment Education and to formulate andimpliment project in relation to Communitydevelopment;\n\n(s)to establish and maintain branches of rural societiesof Sri Siddhartha Foundaion;\n\n(t)to engage in any industry, trade or import andexport enterprises with a view to giving technialknowledge to the people, to promote and carry outagriclutural, industrial and commercial interprises,to help and assist any person to engage in suchenterprises and to conduct trainng programmes andto organize services and propaganda compaigns;\n\n(u)to give aid by scholarships or otherwise tovolunteers and other persons engaged in thefurtherence of the objects of the Corporation;\n\n(v)to establish and maintain libraries, to subscribe forand issue books, journals, souvenirs andperiodicals and to provide such other services asmay be deemed desirable for attaining the objectsof the Corporation;\n\n(w)to promote, organize and hold exhibition,lectures,seminars, symposia, workshops, classes,debates, conferences, tours, execursions or any otheractivity in furtherence or the objects of theCorporation;\n\nSri Siddhartha Foundation (Incorporation)4\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(x)to co-operate and associate with other societies,associations or organizations having objects similarto that of the Corporation; and\n\n(y)to do all such other acts and things as are incidentalor conducive to the attainment of the above objectsor any one of them."
