    "chunk_text": "(f)to establish opportunities for Vocational Trainingand skills development;\n\n(g)to bring about a sustainable development bymaking an awareness in children on preservationof environment and cultivate a habit of plantingtrees;\n\n(i)to conduct eye, blood donation and medical campsto help out children in low income families;\n\n(j)to do all such other acts, matters and things as areincidental or conductive to the attainment of theobjectives of the Corporation.\n\n3Densri Education Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n4.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to do,perform and execute all such acts, matters and thingswhatsoever, as are necessary or desirable for the promotionor furtherance of the objects of the Corporation or any oneof them including the power to open, operate and close bankaccounts, to enter into all contracts directly or through arepresentative as may be necessary, to borrow or raise moneywith or without security, to receive or collect grants anddonations and payments of interests thereto, to invest itsfund in local and foreign investment with the view of raisingfunds of the Corporation, to engage, employ and dismissofficers and servants required for the carrying out of theobjects of the Corporation.\n\n5.(1) The management of the affairs of the Corporationshall be subject to the rules of the Corporation, beadministered by an Executive Council (hereinafter referredto as the \u201cCouncil\u201d) consisting of not more than six officebearers inclusive of the Chairman, Managing Director,Secretary, Treasurer and such number or members as may beprovided or in rules and elected in accordance therewith.\n\n(2) The first Executive Council of the Corporation shall bethe Executive Council of the Foundation holding office onthe day preceding the date of the commencement of this Act."
