    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPresented by Hon. Y. G. Padmasiri, M.P. forKegalle District on 10th May, 2013\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 238]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n(Published in the Gazette on April 29, 2013)\n\nWELFARE SOCIETY OF THE SCHOOL FORTHE MENTALLY SUBNORMAL CHILD(INCORPORATION) (AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Welfare Society of the School for the MentallySubnormal Child (Incorporation) Act, No. 75 of 1988\n\n2\u2014PL 007248\u2014850 (05/2013)\n\nWelfare Society of the School for the MentallySubnormal Child (Incorporation) (Amendment)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n2\u2014PL 007248\u201475 (04/2013)\n\n20\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE WELFARE SOCIETY OF THE SCHOOL FOR THEMENTALLY SUBNORMAL CHILD (INCORPORATION) ACT, NO. 75 OF1988\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Welfare Society of theSchool for the Mentally Subnormal Child (Incorporation)(Amendment) Act, No. of 2013.\n\n2.The long title to the Welfare Society of the School forthe Mentally Subnormal Child (Incorporation) Act(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyrepealed and the following long title substituted thereof:\u2014\n\n\u201cAn ordinance to Incorporate the Chitra Lane WelfareSociety for Children with Special Needs\u201d\n\n3.(1) In the principal enactment and in any other writtenlaw there shall be substituted for the words \u201cthe WelfareSociety of the School for the Mentally Subnormal Child(Incorporation) Act\u201d of the words \u201cthe Chitra Lane WelfareSociety for Children with Special Needs Ordinance\u201d"
