    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 224]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. Prime Minister and Minister of Buddha Sasana andReligious Affairs on March 08, 2013\n\n(Published in the Gazette on February 26, 2013)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\n2-2d\n\nMARRIAGE REGISTRATION (AMENDMENT)\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nto amend the Marriage Registration Ordinance (Chapter 112)\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 24 of the Marriage Registration Ordinance (Chap-ter 112) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) by specifying the mode ofpayment of fees to the registrar of the division and the District Registrar.\n\nClause 3 : This clause amends section 27 of the principal enactment by revising theamount of fees to be paid to the District Registrar and specifying the mode of payment.\n\nClause 4 : This clause amends section 34 by specifying the fees to be paid to the Registrar.\n\nClause 5 : This clause amends section 38 by revising the amount of fees to be paid andspecifies the mode of payment.\n\nClause 6 : This clause amends section 51 by requiring the applicant to pay an amount inplace of affixing stamps.\n\nClause 7 : This clause amends section 62 of the principal enactment by giving the powerto the Minister to revise fees enumerated in the second schedule by rules published in theGazette.\n\nClause 8 : This clause replaces the second schedule to this Act.\n\n1Marriage Registration (Amendment)\n\nShort titleand date ofoperation.5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n2\u2014PL 007047\u20141,600 (03/2013)\n\n25\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 6/2013.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE MARRIAGE REGISTRATION ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 112)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-"
