    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nMUSLIM MARRIAGE AND DIVORCE(AMENDMENT)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 225]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Prime Minister and the Minister of Buddha Sasana andReligious Affairs on 08th March, 2013\n\n(Published in the Gazette on February 26, 2013)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nto amend the Muslim Marriage and Divorce Act (Chapter 115)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\n2-2d\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nThe amendments made to sections 18 and 94 of the Muslim Marriage and Divorce Act(Chapter 115) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201c principal enactment\u201d) by clauses 2 and 3of this Act specifies fees to be paid in cash.\n\n1Muslim Marriage and Divorce (Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 16/2013.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE MUSLIM MARRIAGE AND DIVORCE ACT(CHAPTER 115)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Muslim Marriage andDivorce (Amendment) Act, No. of 2013 and shall be deemedto have come into operation from January 1, 2013.\n\n2.Section 18 of the Muslim Marriage and Divorce Act(Chapter 115) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended by the repeal of subsection(3) of that section and the substitution therefor of thefollowing subsection:\u2014\n\n\u201c(3) The prescribed fee shall be paid by thebridegroom.\u201d.\n\n3.Section 94 of the principal enactment is herebyamended in paragraph (h) of subsection (1) of that sectionby the substitution, for the words \u201c the stamp fee to be paidon a certified copy\u201d, of the words \u201c the fee to be paid on acertified copy\u201d."
  },
