    "chunk_size_bytes": 2099,
    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPOWERS OF ATTORNEY (AMENDMENT)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 230]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Prime Minister and Minister of Buddha Sasana andReligious Affairs on 08th March, 2013\n\n(Published in the Gazette on February 26, 2013)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nto amend the Powers of Attorney Ordinance (Chapter 122)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\n2-2d\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2:This clause amends the Section 9 of the Powers of Attorney Ordinance(Chapter 122)(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment \u201d) by revising the feesspecified in the schedule.\n\nClause 3:This clause insert a new section 10 to the principal enactment whichenables the Minister to make Regulations.\n\n1 Powers of Attorney (Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 19/2013\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE POWERS OF ATTORNEY ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 122)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This act may be cited as the Powers of Attorney(Amendment) Act, No. of 2013 and shall be deemedto have come into operation on January 1, 2013.\n\n2.Section 9 of the Powers of Attorney Ordinance(Chapter122)(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment \u201d) is hereby amended by the repeal of that sectionand the substitution therefor of the following:\u2014\n\n9. The following fees or such other amountas may be prescribed by the Minister from timeto time shall be payable to the Registrar-General under this Ordinance:\u2014\n\nFor the registration of anypower of attorney\n\nFor the registration of anynotification of cancellationor revocation of anyregistered power of attorney\n\nFor every application toinspect the records For every application for acertified copy of a registeredpower of attorney\n\nFor every certified copy issuedunder section 7, per Folio\n\nShort titleand date ofoperation.\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n\u201cFees\n\nRs.1,500.00"
