    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nBIRTHS AND DEATHS REGISTRATION(AMENDMENT)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 226]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Prime Minister and Minister of Buddha Sasana andReligious Affairs on 08th March, 2013\n\n(Published in the Gazette on February 26, 2013)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nto amend the Births and Deaths Registration Act (Chapter 110)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-PL 007081 \u20141,100 (03/2013)\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nThe amendments made to sections 24,27,27A, 28, 36, 52 and 61 of the Births and DeathsRegistration Act (Chapter 110) by clauses 2,3,4,5,6,7,8, of this Act revises the fees payableand specifies the mode of payment.\n\n1Births and Deaths Registration (Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n2\u2014PL007017\u2014425 (02/2013)\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 17/2013\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE BIRTHS AND DEATHS REGISTRATION ACT(CHAPTER 110)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Births and deathsRegistration (Amendment) Act, No. of 2013 and shall bedeemed to have come into operation from January 1, 2013.\n\n2.Section 24 of the Births and Deaths registration Act,(Chapter 110) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended in subsection (2) of thatsection, by the substitution for all the words from \u201ceverysuch declaration shall\u201d to the words \u201cthe stamps shall besupplied by the declarant\u201d of the words \u201cevery suchdeclaration shall be accompanied by a fee of rupees fifty orsuch other amount as may be prescribed by the Minister,which shall be paid by the declarant.\u201d"
