    "chunk_size_bytes": 1997,
    "chunk_text": "BE It Therefore enacted by the Parliament of theDemocratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka:\u2014\n\n1.This Act, may be cited as the Lakshman WasanthaPerera Community Development Foundation(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2012.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be:\u2014\n\nIncorporationof theLakshmanWasanthaPereraCommunityDevelopmentFoundation.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.30\n\nLakshman Wasantha Perera CommunityDevelopment Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n2\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(a)to undertake the execution of road developmentand housing schemes, the construction anddevelopment of hospitals, Aesthetic EducationalCentres, schools, community centres and such otheractivities with a view to developing towards andvillages ;\n\n(b)to assist the students who need help;\n\n(c)to establish and maintain libraries, reading roomsand study centers;\n\n(d)to collect, print, publish and distribute books,journals and magazines;\n\n(e)to maintain cordial relationship with otherorganizations having similar objects;\n\n(f)to plan and implement community welfare,educational and social development projects in SriLanka;\n\n(g)to promote education, health, recreation, cultureand agriculture, to provide grants, scholarships,gifts, donations and financial assistance for theimprovement, extension and publicize knowledgeand to establish institutions for this purpose;\n\n(h)to promote areas relating to traditional knowledgeand to establish institutions for this purpose;\n\n(i)to commence and maintain projects for theprotection and conservation of the environment ;and\n\n(j)to liaise and co- ordinate with other local or foreigninstitutions which have similar objects\n\n4. (1) The affairs of the Corporation shall, subject tothe other provision of this Act and the rules in force for thetime being of the Corporation, be administered by a Board\n\nManagementof the affairsof theCorporation.30\n\n3Lakshman Wasantha Perera CommunityDevelopment Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25"
  },
