    "chunk_size_bytes": 1463,
    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of June 08, 2012\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 11. 06. 2012)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\n(Private Member\u2019s Bill)\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nSRI GUNARATHANA INTERNATIONALFOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Sriyani Wijewickrama, for\n\nDigamadulla District\n\nto incorporate the Sri Gunarathana International Foundation\n\n1Sri Gunarathana International Foundation(Incorporation)\n\nal Foundation (Gaz)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SRI GUNARATHANA INTERNATIONALFOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the\u201cSri Gunarathana International Foundation\u201d has heretoforebeen formed in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out its objects and transacting all matters connectedwith the said Foundation according to the rules agreed to byits members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated, and it will be expedient to grant the saidapplication:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sri GunarathanaInternational Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of2012."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_bills",
    "doc_id": "2012-06-11-2012-06-11-02-2012-en",
    "num": "2012-06-11-02-2012-en",
    "date_str": "2012-06-11",
    "description": "Sri Gunarathana International Foundation (Incorporation) GS",
    "url_metadata": "https://documents.gov.lk/view/bills/bl_2012.html",
    "lang": "en",
    "url_pdf": "https://documents.gov.lk/view/bills/2012/6/02-2012_E.pdf",
    "doc_number": "02/2012",
    "chunk_id": "2012-06-11-2012-06-11-02-2012-en-0001",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "9f21d4912ddfa9daac846a9fdb8306da",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1992,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sri GunarathanaInternational Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of2012.\n\nIncorporationof the SriGunarathanaInternationalFoundation.\n\n2Sri Gunarathana International Foundation(Incorporation)\n\nPL 005773 Sri Gunarathana Internationa\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to take necessary action for the extension andprotection of Buddhism;\n\n(b)to assist in the establisment of Dhamma schools, toestablish and conduct of centres for this purpose;\n\n(c)to take action for the conservation and theprotection of social values;\n\n(d)to establish institutions which are actively involvedin eradication social unrest;\n\n(e)to formulate systematic and effective programmesfor eradicating poverty;\n\n(f)to organize activites for the social welfare anddevelopment, using physical resources andknowledge which are inherent to Sri Lanka;\n\n(g)to promote mutual understanding and co-operationas social and national level in the human society;\n\n(h)to plan and implement community welfare,educational and social development projects inSri Lanka;\n\n(i)to promote education, health, recreation, cultureand agriculture, to provide grants, scholarships,gifts, donations and financial assistance for theimprovement, extension and publicize knowledgeand to establish institutions for this purpose;\n\n(j)to promote areas relating to traditional knowledgeand establish institutions for this purpose;\n\n(k)to commence and maintain projects for theprotection and conservation of the environment;\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n3Sri Gunarathana International Foundation(Incorporation)\n\nal Foundation (Gaz)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(l)to grow and maintain herbal plants and other plantsrequired to produce indigenos medicine;\n\n(m)to commence herbal parks and gardens and toprovide assistance for this purpose;"
