    "chunk_size_bytes": 1527,
    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n[Bill No. 130]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto incorporate the Minuwangoda Sinha Foundation\n\nMINUWANGODA SINHA FOUNDATION(INCORPORATION)\n\nPresented by Hon. M. Joseph Michael Perera, M. P. for Gampaha Districton October 18, 2011\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n(Published in the Gazette on September 19, 2011)\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\n1Minuwangoda Sinha Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n2\u2014PL 006232\u2014 75 (09/2011)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE MINUWANGODA SINHA FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the\u201cMinuwangoda Sinha Foundation\u201d has heretofore beenestablished in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out and transacting all objects and mattersconnected with the said Foundation according to the rulesagreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the application.\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Minuwangoda SinhaFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2011."
  },
