    "chunk_text": "(p)to do all such acts and things as may be necessaryfor the accomplishment of all or any of the objectsof the Corporation.\n\nD. M. Dassanayake Social Services andCharity Foundation (Incorporation)4\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n4.(1) The affairs of the Foundation shall, subject to therule of the Corporation for the time being in force, beadministered by a Governing Council consisting of theChairman of the Foundation, Mrs. Indrani Dassanayake whois a Provincial Councilor of the Northwestern ProvincialCouncil, Secretary, Treasurer, two assistant secretaries ansix committee members.\n\n(2) The first Governing Council of the Corporation shallconsist of the members holding office in the Foundation onthe day preceding the date of commencement of this Act.\n\n(3) The incumbent Chairman of the foundation Mrs.Indrani Dassanayake shall be the lifelong Chairman of theCorporation unless she resigns from her post prematurely.\n\n5.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have power\u2014\n\n(a)to buy, acquire, rent, construct or obtain otherwiseany land or building required for the purpose of theCorporation;\n\n(b)to obtain loans or take money from state orapproved banks and institutions for the purpose ofthe Corporation or to receive grants and donations(local or foreign) with the approval of theGoverning Council;\n\n(c)to make, write, accept, offer discounts, transact,purchase, sell, issue bills of exchange, cheques,promissory notes and other negotiable instrumentsand to open, maintain and close bank accounts;\n\n(d)to invest any fund deemed as not required for thepurpose of the Corporation in a manner deemedsuitable by the Governing Council;\n\n(e)to appeal for and receive contributions,endowments, grants and donations all types of gifts;\n\nManagementof the affairsof theCorporation.\n\nGeneralpowers of theCorporation.\n\n30\n\n5D. M. Dassanayake Social Services andCharity Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30"
