    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 100]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Prime Minister and Minister of Buddha Sasana andReligious Affairs on 08th April, 2011\n\n(Published in the Gazette on March 28, 2011)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\nPENSIONS (CONSEQUENTIAL PROVISIONS)\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nto make provision for certain consequential matters arising out of theenactment of the Employees Pension Benefits Fund Act and the OverseasEmployees Pension Benefits Fund Act, pursuant to a budget proposal in the2011 Budget ; and to provide for matters connected therewith or incidental\n\nthereto\n\n1Pensions (Consequential Provisions)\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n2\u2014PL 005700\u20141,100 (04/2011)\n\n25\n\nL.D.\u2014O 26/2011.\n\nAN ACT TO MAKE PROVISION FOR CERTAIN CONSEQUENTIAL MATTERS\n\nARISING OUT OF THE ENACTMENT OF THE EMPLOYEES PENSIONBENEFITS FUND ACT AND THE OVERSEAS EMPLOYEES PENSIONBENEFITS FUND ACT, PURSUANT TO A BUDGET PROPOSAL IN THE2011 BUDGET ; AND TO PROVIDE FOR MATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH\n\nOR INCIDENTAL THERETO.\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Pensions (ConsequentialProvisions) Act, No. of 2011.\n\n2.For the avoidance of doubts it is hereby declaredthat the provisions of the Acts specified in the First Scheduleto this Act shall be deemed to have no application in respectof the enactments specified in the Second Schedule to thisAct, and specifically in relation to the provisions dealingwith administration of the Acts and its application,membership, contributions and mode of collection ofcontributions."
