    "chunk_text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of this Act,such and so many persons as now are members of the \u201cHeadangEducation Foundation\u201d or shall hereafter be admitted asmembers of the \u201cHeadang Education Foundation\u201d shall be abody corporate (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d)with perpetual succession under the name and the style ofthe \u201cHeadang Education Foundation\u201d, and by that name maysue and be sued in all Courts, with full power and authorityto have and use a common seal and alter the same at itspleasure.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(b) to establish children\u2019s parks that will be helpful inthe mental and physical development of children ;\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorporationof theHeadangEducationFoundation\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n10\n\nPreamble.\n\n5\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\nHeadang Education Foundation(Incorporation)2\n\n(c) to print, publish, distribute books, magazines,newspaper and journals and to establish and maintainlibraries ;\n\n(d) to provide books, equipments, clothing, computersand accessories, loans and other financial assistanceto the needy children of low income families ;\n\n(e) to establish centers with residential facilities for theprovision of education to children of low incomefamilies who have lost either mother or father and forchildren of vulnerable families whose parents areemployed overseas and to integrate children withschools ;\n\n(f) to establish Information Techonology Centersthroughout the island to enhance science educationand develop the country ;\n\n(g) to establish and develop schools to provide educationin English medium, and to provide common amenitiesand maintain the same ;\n\n(h) to initial, develop and maintain Dhamma schools forBuddhist Dhamma school education ;\n\n(i) to work in close collaboration with local and foreigngovernmental and non-governmental organizationsto provide education and vocational training forstudents ;\n\n(j) to implement projects to generate income for theFoundation ; and"
