    "chunk_text": "(l) creating skilled athletes to achieve national andinternational goals by launching a programmenamed \u201cKreeda Saviya\u201d and working to preservetraditional sports while organizing traditional sportsevents to conserve them as national heritages; and\n\n(m) training and establishing an Elite Task Force fordisaster management consisting of hundred capableyouth that would provide active intervention duringregional as well as national level outbreaks.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n4.Subject to the provisions of this Act, or any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power\u2014\n\n(a) to purchase, acquire, rent, construct or otherwiseobtain lands or buildings which may be requiredfor the purposes of the Corporation;\n\n(b) to open, maintain and close bank accounts;\n\n(c) to obtain financial loans with or without securityor to collect money;\n\n(d) to accept and collect local or foreign financial orother, grants and donations;\n\n(e) to recruit, employ, discipline and dismiss theservices of the relevant officers and servants; and\n\n(f) to establish necessary committees to enhance ordevelop the objects of the Corporation or some ofthe objects of the Corporation appropriately or toexecute any and every kind of suitable action andto perform and implement necessary things.\n\n5.(1) The Management of the affairs of the Corporationsubject to the other provisions of this Act and the rules inforce for the time being of the Corporation be administeredby a Management Board consisting of Chairperson Secretary,Treasurer, Assistant Secretary, Vice Chairperson, Organizerand the Chairperson of the Advisory Board."
