    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of June 18, 2010\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 21.06.2010)\n\nTHIDORA-THEATRE INSTITUTE FOR DISABILITYORIENTED RESEARCH AND ADVOCACY(INCORPORATION)\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Sunil Handunnetti, M. P. forColombo District\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto incorporate the Thidora-Theatre Institute for Disability OrientedResearch and Advocacy\n\n(Private Member\u2019s Bill)\n\nThidora-Theatre Institute for Disability OrientedResearch and Advocacy (Incorporation)1\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE THIDORA-THEATRE INSTITUTE FORDISABILITY ORIENTED RESEARCH AND ADVOCACY\n\nWHEREAS an Association called and known as the\u201cThidora-Theatre Institute for Disability Oriented Researchand Advocacy \u201d has been formed for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out and transacting all objects and matters connectedwith the said Association according to the rules agreed to byits members :\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Association has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated, and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Thidora-TheatreInstitute for Disability Oriented Research and Advocacy(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2010."
