    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Rahula College MataraPast Students Association (Colombo Branch) (Incorporation)Act, No. of 2010.\n\n3.The general object for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)To promote educational, cultural and socialactivities among past pupils, present pupils, presentteachers and former teachers of Rahula College ;\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15Short title.\n\nIncorporationof the RahulaCollege PastStudentsAssociation(ColomboBranch).\n\n20\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n25\n\n30\n\nPreamble.\n\nRahula College Matara Past Students Association (Colombo Branch) (Incorporation)\n\n2\n\n(b)To preserve the natural resources and createinfrastructure facilities and develop and maintainsame for the well being of the students of RahulaCollege ;\n\n(c)To promote Welfare, Cultural and SocialDevelopment activities among students andteachers so as to improve cordial relationshipbetween the two groups ;\n\n(d)To establish the Rahula Scholarships Trust for awardof scholarships prizes and other grants ;\n\n(e)To establish libraries, research and training centersand maintain same ;\n\n(f)For the purpose of Vocational training to studentsmaintain cordial relationships with foreign and localnon governmental organizations ;\n\n(g)To commence projects which generate income to beused for the activities of the Corporation ;"
