    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of May 07, 2010\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 10. 05. 2010)\n\nPILIYANDALA DHARMASHASTRODAYA PIRIVENVIHARASTHA SANWARDHANA SABHAWA(INCORPORATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto incorporate the Piliyandala Dharmashastrodaya Piriven ViharasthaSanwardhana Sabhawa\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Karu JayasuriyaM. P. for Gampaha District\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5.\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\n(Private Member\u2019s Bill)\n\n1Piliyandala Dharmashastrodaya Piriven Viharastha\n\nSanwardhana Sabhawa (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nShort title.\n\nPreamble.\n\n25\n\n2\u2014PL 004821 \u201480 (05/2010)\n\nL.D.\u2014O. (Inc.) 61/92.\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE PILIYANDALA DHARMASHASTRODAYA\n\nPIRIVEN VIHARASTHA SANWARDHANA SABHAWA\n\nWHEREAS a Sabhawa called and known as the \u201cPiliyandalaDharmashastrodaya Piriven Viharastha SanwardhanaSabhawa\u201d has heretofore been formed at Piliyandala for thepurpose of effectually carrying out its objects and transactingall matters connected with the Sabhawa, according to therules agreed to, by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Sabhawa has applied to beincorporated in order to enable it more effectively to carryout and fulfil the several objects and purposes for which itwas formed and it will be for the public advantage to grantthe application :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the PiliyandalaDharmashastrodaya Piriven Viharastha SanwardhanaSabhawa (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2010."
