    "chunk_text": "(t)to make comparative study of religiousphilosophies and of the Buddhist philosophies ofeducation and other modern philosophies ofeducation, for the purpose of evolving a theory ofeducation relevant to contemporary society;\n\n(u)to conduct courses of vocational education for theyouths in Sri Lanka;\n\n(v)to train students in small industries and help themfinancially or otherwise to establish themselves asuseful citizens;\n\n(x)to grant medical relief, clothing and shelter to theneedy, the orphaned and the sick;\n\n(y)to establish and maintain orphanages and homesfor the aged and the destitute and to establish socialwelfare centres;\n\n(z)to provide welfare facilities for the disabled, thedeaf, the dumb and the blind;\n\n5Piliyandala Dharmashastrodaya Piriven Viharastha\n\nSanwardhana Sabhawa (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(aa)to give aid by way of scholarships, or cash orotherwise to monks, volunteers and other personsengaged in the furtherance of the objects of theCorporation;\n\n(bb)to promote arrange, organise and hold exhibitions,lectures, seminars, symposia, workshops, classes,debates, conferences, tours, excursions or any otheractivities, in furtherance of the objects of theCorporation;\n\n(cc)to co-operate and associate with other associations,societies or organizations having objects similar tothose of the Corporation;\n\n(dd)to engage in any industry, trade or import and exportbusiness, and to promote and carry on any businessand to promote and carry on any agricultural,industrial or commercial enterprise, to provide aidand assistance to any persons to carry on suchenterprises, to conduct training programmes and toorganize service and propaganda campaigns, witha view to providing the public with technologicalexpertise; and\n\n(ee)to do all other acts and things as are or may benecessary or incidental to the attainment of all orany of the aforesaid objects."
