    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of May 07, 2010\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 10. 05. 2010)\n\nPAHALAGAMA SRI SOMARATHANANAYAKA THERO FOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto incorporate the Pahalagama Sri Somarathana Nayaka Thero\n\nFoundation\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Vijitha Herath, M. P. forGampaha District\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5.\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\n(Private Member\u2019s Bill)\n\n1Pahalagama Sri Somarathana Nayaka Thero\n\nFoundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nShort title.\n\nPreamble.\n\n25\n\n2\u2014PL 004814 \u201480 (04/2010)\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE PAHALAGAMA SRI SOMARATHANA\n\nNAYAKA THERO FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the\u201cPahalagama Sri Somarathana Nayaka Thero\u201d has heretoforebeen formed for the purpose of effectually carrying out itsobjects and transacting all matters connected with theFoundation, according to the rules agreed to, by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has applied to beincorporated in order to enable it more effectively to carryout and fulfil the several objects and purposes for which itwas formed and it will be for the public advantage to grantthe application :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Pahalagama SriSomarathana Nayaka Thero Foundation (Incorporation) Act,No. of 2010."
