    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Pahalagama SriSomarathana Nayaka Thero Foundation (Incorporation) Act,No. of 2010.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)conducting Dhamma sermons, discussions andseminars;\n\nIncorporationof thePahalagamaSriSomarathanaNayakaTheroFoundation\n\nGeneralObjects oftheCorporation.\n\n30\n\nPahalagama Sri Somarathana Nayaka Thero\n\nFoundation (Incorporation)2\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(b)printing, publishing and distribution of Buddhistbooks, magazines, journals, papers and programmes;\n\n(c)setting up and maintenance of reading halls, lecturehalls, and academic institutions and study,promotion and propaganda of Buddhism;\n\n(d)organising and conducting of all activities for theimprovement of Buddhist culture and moraldevelopment;\n\n(e)to take steps to improve the way of life of theBuddhists and to promote national and religiouscustoms and to improve the spiritual virtues andsocial values;\n\n(f)to take steps to save the younger generation fromsocial and economic hardships irrespective ofnational, religious and/or ethnic differences;\n\n(g)to conduct social service activities in accordancewith Buddhist principles and to encourage theBuddhists to engage in such activities;\n\n(h)to establish and maintain institutions foreducational and social service activities such aschildrens\u2019 homes, elders\u2019 homes, hostels and othersocial service institutions."
